# MCP Brain Tools Server - Implementation Plan

> **Goal:** Build a production-ready, sellable MCP server for multi-agent orchestration
> **Target:** 100% feature utilization in God Mode + PyPI distribution

---

## Market Assessment

### Existing MCP Marketplaces
| Platform | Type | Submission |
|----------|------|------------|
| **MCP.so** | Main community directory | GitHub issue |
| **mcpmarket.com** | Commercial marketplace | Direct submission |
| **glama.ai** | AI tools marketplace | Application |
| **MCP Registry** | Official Anthropic registry | GitHub PR |

### Competing Products (Multi-Agent/Orchestration)
| Product | Focus | Gap We Fill |
|---------|-------|-------------|
| None found | — | **First MCP for multi-agent orchestration** |
| LangGraph MCP | Graphs | No portable brain |
| CrewAI | Teams | No event-driven triggers |

### Unique Value Proposition
**"Nuclear Brain MCP" - The first MCP server for solo founders to run autonomous AI agents**
- Event-driven agent orchestration via LLM
- Portable `.brain/` folder architecture
- Works with Claude, Gemini, OpenAI in any MCP-compatible client

