## Proposed Package Structure

```
mcp-server-nuclear-brain/
├── pyproject.toml                 # Package config
├── README.md                      # Documentation
├── LICENSE                        # MIT
├── src/
│   └── mcp_server_nuclear_brain/
│       ├── __init__.py
│       ├── __main__.py           # Entry point
│       ├── server.py             # FastMCP server
│       ├── tools/                # MCP Tools
│       │   ├── events.py         # emit_event, read_events
│       │   ├── state.py          # get_state, update_state
│       │   ├── agents.py         # trigger_agent, list_agents
│       │   ├── triggers.py       # get_triggers, evaluate_trigger
│       │   └── artifacts.py      # read_artifact, write_artifact
│       ├── resources/            # MCP Resources
│       │   ├── brain_state.py    # state.json as resource
│       │   └── events_stream.py  # events.jsonl as resource
│       └── prompts/              # MCP Prompts
│           └── synthesizer.py    # Synthesizer activation prompt
├── tests/
│   ├── test_tools.py
│   ├── test_resources.py
│   └── test_integration.py
└── examples/
    ├── claude_desktop_config.json
    └── vscode_mcp.json
```

